  "description": "MOVEHOME ESTATE AGENTS ... are delighted to present this bright and spacious one-bedroom apartment to the Dublin rental market.\nSituated within the historic and beautifully maintained Drummond House, and recently refurbished to a very high standard, this property offers a rare opportunity to live in the heart of Chapelizod, one of Dublin’s most charming and sought-after riverside villages.\n\nThe accommodation comprises a welcoming entrance hallway that leads into a bright living and kitchen area, with access to a private L shaped courtyard with a northwesterly orientation and flooded with natural light. The recently renovated kitchen is efficiently designed with ample storage and modern appliances, offering maximum convenience. The generous double bedroom features a beautifully presented ensuite bathroom.\n\nDrummond House is a private and quiet building consisting of ten units in total, ensuring a peaceful residential atmosphere.\nThis prime location is just a short stroll from the gates of the Phoenix Park and the scenic banks of the River Liffey, offering an unparalleled lifestyle for outdoor enthusiasts. Parking is included.\n\nChapelizod village provides a host of local amenities including cozy cafes, traditional pubs, and local shops, all while remaining incredibly well-connected to the City Centre via frequent bus corridors.\n\nA significant benefit to this property is the inclusive nature of the tenancy, as both refuse collection and building Wi-Fi are included in the monthly rent at no additional cost. There is also private parking availiable to the front, which is also included in the rent. \n\nViewing is highly recommended and strictly by appointment only with MoveHome Estate Agents.",
